    <section className="ms-intro ms-section"><div className="ms-wrap ms-intro__grid"><div><Label>THE MECHANIC APPROACH</Label><h2>GOOD WORK.<br /><em>BETTER RIDES.</em></h2></div><div><p className="ms-lead">A bike is more than a way to get around. It deserves attention from people who understand what the ride means to you.</p><p>Tell us what you’re experiencing. We’ll help you understand the next step, from routine maintenance to finding the cause of a fault.</p><Link to="/services" className="ms-inline">GET TO KNOW OUR SERVICES <ArrowRight size={16} /></Link></div></div></section>
